{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659766",
      "title": "New Project: First Steps Towards Our Tic-Tac-Toe Game",
      "sourceHash": "0e109eac1fa95bbabf4fa09fdb74f5c6442286a5b70d1731069028b038088f9f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.209,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "So let's now start working on the main game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 7.2,
          "en": "And for this here, in this app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.2,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "we'll of course need to add a couple of building blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.348,
          "en": "Because in the end, in the finished game,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.348,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "I wanna have an area where we can view the names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.509,
          "en": "of the players and where we can also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.509,
          "end": 21.873,
          "en": "edit those player names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.8,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "Then of course, we'll need the main game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 30.5,
          "en": "and then we also need a log below that game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.5,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "that in the end, outputs information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 35.91,
          "en": "about the turns that the players took",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.91,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "while playing the game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "So we got these three big building blocks here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 44.91,
          "en": "and I'm going to start here with the players feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "So without putting these player names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 50.162,
          "en": "and adding the logic that allows the user of the website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.162,
          "end": 52.473,
          "en": "to edit those player names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.73,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "Before that, first of all, in this app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "I'll use a main element as a wrapper element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 62.46,
          "en": "around these different building blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.46,
          "end": 65.19,
          "en": "And then in there I'll add yet another wrapper,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "a div with an ID of \"game container.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 71.64,
          "en": "And I'm using this ID because of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.64,
          "end": 73.65,
          "en": "in the index CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.65,
          "end": 78.123,
          "en": "I'm looking for this ID with some CSS styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 82.68,
          "en": "And I wanna have my players building block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 86.46000000000001,
          "en": "and the game board building block in this game container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.46000000000001,
          "end": 89.91,
          "en": "and then the log below that outside of that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.91,
          "end": 92.283,
          "en": "simply for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.18,
          "end": 96.57,
          "en": "Now as mentioned, I wanna start with the players area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.57,
          "end": 99.53399999999999,
          "en": "And here, I'll start by outputting an ordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.53399999999999,
          "end": 102.21000000000001,
          "en": "Ordered list because technically of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.21000000000001,
          "end": 104.75999999999999,
          "en": "the order matters because we first have the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.75999999999999,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "of the first player and then of the second player.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.14,
          "en": "It's a small semantic detail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.14,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "Not too important here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 113.13300000000001,
          "en": "but that's why I'm going for an ordered list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "Now, I'll give that ordered list an ID of \"players,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "again for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.539,
          "en": "And then in there, in that list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.539,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "I of course wanna have two list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "for the first player and for the second player.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 131.482,
          "en": "And we'll start simple by just outputting the names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.482,
          "end": 134.28,
          "en": "of these players and their symbols",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.28,
          "end": 136.53,
          "en": "because since we're playing tic-tac-toe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.53,
          "end": 138.6,
          "en": "every player has their own symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.6,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "which is shown on the game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "whenever a square is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 145.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, for styling reasons, I'll add a span here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.92000000000002,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "which contains the player name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 150.626,
          "en": "So player one, for example, for a start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.626,
          "end": 154.2,
          "en": "And of course we're soon going to make this dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 156.54,
          "en": "but for the moment I'll hard code this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.54,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "And I'll give this span a class, a CSS class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 163.14,
          "en": "by adding the class name \"prop\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.14,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "as you learned before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "And here the class is player name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 168.78300000000002,
          "en": "again for styling purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.74,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "And then I'll add a second span here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 174.349,
          "en": "below that player name span.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.349,
          "end": 178.867,
          "en": "And here, I'll give that span a class name of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.867,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "\"player symbol.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 183.963,
          "en": "And for the first player, I want to output an X here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.67,
          "end": 187.23,
          "en": "And now we can copy this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 187.23,
          "end": 191.16,
          "en": "and replace this second list item with this new list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 194.244,
          "en": "and just adjust the data to say \"player two\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.244,
          "end": 197.403,
          "en": "and use the symbol \"O\" here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.02,
          "end": 201.36,
          "en": "Now, this is not the finished players area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 204.69,
          "en": "A lot of things are missing here, but it's a start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.69,
          "end": 209.25,
          "en": "If we save this, we should see this here on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 212.61,
          "en": "We should see this main game area, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.61,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "with the black background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 216.54,
          "en": "And then we got the player one output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.54,
          "end": 219.087,
          "en": "and the player two output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.087,
          "end": 224.087,
          "en": "Now, the next step is to make these player names dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.13,
          "end": 226.5,
          "en": "and to add an edit button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.5,
          "end": 229.917,
          "en": "that allows us to actually show an input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.917,
          "end": 232.05,
          "en": "that allows the user of the website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.05,
          "end": 234,
          "en": "to edit those player names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 236.5,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we're going to add next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}